			"notes": "## 4.1.0\n\n- Added support for **Minecraft 1.20.1, 1.21.1, 1.21.5, 1.21.8, and 1.21.10**, bringing the total to **11 supported versions** with universal and individual downloads.\n- Redesigned the **detailed HUD** into a wider, shorter layout while keeping search targets, status, and saved prices visible.\n- Added **independent HUD width and height scaling** through Move HUD, alongside overall size adjustment and edge/center snapping.\n- Fixed corrupted characters in trade notifications.\n- Updated enchantment suggestions and trade catalogs to match each newly supported Minecraft version.\n\nTested across all 11 supported versions."
