			"notes": "## 4.0.0\n\n- **Search directly from the villager trading screen** with profession-specific trade suggestions.\n- **Resize the HUD from 50% to 150%**, with optional snapping to screen edges and center when moving it.\n- Added an optional **detailed HUD** showing your targets, search status, price limits, and saved best offers, with pages for longer lists.\n- Improved search-list scrolling so entries remain accessible above the buttons, including at smaller window sizes.\n- Resume interrupted searches without losing your attempt count or elapsed search time.\n- Keep found offers saved and continue searching for better prices without rebuilding your wishlist.\n- Added a **universal JAR** supporting Minecraft **1.21.11, 26.1, 26.1.1, 26.1.2, 26.2, and 26.3**. Separate version downloads remain available.\n\nInstall either the universal JAR or your version-specific JAR, with dependencies matching your Minecraft version."
