			"notes": "# Version 3.1.0\n\n- Added quick villager and workstation selection with visible markers and confirmation.\n- Added searching by normal item and enchantment names, with Minecraft item icons.\n- Added profession-specific vanilla novice trade suggestions, while keeping custom searches available.\n- Added named wishlists, starter presets, duplication, and clipboard import/export.\n- Added a saved-trade review screen showing found levels, quantities, costs, and previous best prices, with options to keep a result, search for better, or select the next villager.\n- Added optional search and found-trade details to the compact, movable HUD.\n- Improved interruption messages with clearer instructions and a Retry option that preserves session statistics.\n- Added optional found-trade notifications and a sound toggle, preserving the original “ching” sound.\n- Now you can control the trades you want for a villager from the trade menu!\n\nAvailable for **Minecraft 1.21.11, 26.1.2, 26.2, and 26.3** on Fabric."
		},
