			"notes": "# v2.2.0\n\n* Added regular item searches alongside enchanted books, with quantity and payment limits and support for all **13 profession workstations**\n* Found targets now keep their **saved results and best offers** instead of being deleted, with **Search better, Acquired, Ignore, and Reset** actions; equal or worse offers are skipped when searching for improvements\n* Added **pause/resume** without losing attempts or active time, automatic pauses for missing resources or recoverable problems, and a **New session** option to reset statistics\n* Redesigned the HUD into a **compact, outlined, movable panel** with saved positioning, drag-to-move controls, and a reset option; detailed results remain available in configuration and chat\n* Improved configuration with a scrollable search list, separate editing screens, a direct **Move HUD** button, vanilla book price references, and hints showing your assigned keybinds\n* Added **Russian translations** and **Minecraft 26.3 support**\n* Fixed enchantment autocomplete issues, overlapping search rows, HUD dragging, stale trade checks, and rerolling continuing after a match\n* Added locked-trade safeguards, improved hotbar tool selection, and corrected development launch settings for the reported 26.3 startup crash\n* Applied and tested these updates across **1.21.11, 26.1.2, 26.2, and 26.3**, with consistent **2.2.0** release filenames"
		},
